#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:10002
#: 0f686bd79fc040eb86cbdf0824503759
msgid "PyCBC Interoperability: From gwexpy Preprocessing to GW Search"
msgstr "PyCBC 連携：gwexpy 前処理から重力波探索まで"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:10004
#: d583a30772f649b98f5841a3514fd24f
msgid ""
"[PyCBC](https://pycbc.org/) is a Python toolkit for gravitational-wave data "
"analysis, including matched-filter searches for compact binary coalescences "
"(CBC).  gwexpy provides **bidirectional converters** between its own data "
"types and PyCBC's `TimeSeries` / `FrequencySeries`."
msgstr ""
"[PyCBC](https://pycbc.org/) は連星合体（CBC）のマッチトフィルター探索や "
"パラメータ推定を行う重力波データ解析ツールキットです。 gwexpy は自身のデータ型と PyCBC の `TimeSeries` / "
"`FrequencySeries` 間の **双方向コンバータ**を提供します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:10009
#: ae6b94ee5fe34a2e8605b9c2a1cea5d5
msgid "This enables a natural workflow where:"
msgstr "これにより、以下のような自然なワークフローが実現します："

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:10010
#: 51a1a385934c4a31ba97936f69e1b27a
msgid ""
"**gwexpy** handles data loading, preprocessing, and noise characterisation"
msgstr "**gwexpy**: データ読み込み、前処理、ノイズ特性評価"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:10011
#: 6465b658e02746e79a02287723a3f513
msgid "**PyCBC** performs the matched-filter search or parameter estimation"
msgstr "**PyCBC**: マッチトフィルター探索やパラメータ推定"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:10012
#: 4559170150f249a7a7c6ecbbed9cfe4c
msgid "**gwexpy** post-processes and visualises the search output"
msgstr "**gwexpy**: 探索結果の後処理と可視化"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:10014
#: 4091ce0a2c414c5a88367dd1d5eb2589
msgid "**What this tutorial covers:**"
msgstr "**このチュートリアルで学ぶこと：**"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:10015
#: 17fb7a0762c145c9badabd36b5cc45af
msgid "Converting a gwexpy `TimeSeries` to PyCBC and back"
msgstr "gwexpy `TimeSeries` を PyCBC に変換して戻す"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:10016
#: e9cd6ac98bb24effb470df699c2ebef7
msgid "Converting a gwexpy `FrequencySeries` (ASD) to a PyCBC PSD"
msgstr "gwexpy `FrequencySeries`（ASD）を PyCBC PSD に変換する"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:10017
#: da7e3a7f8e2f472085b265e9d0dcc1d2
msgid ""
"Full preprocessing pipeline: conditioning → matched filter (simulated CBC)"
msgstr "完全な前処理パイプライン：コンディショニング → マッチトフィルター"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:10018
#: bd2df52589b4483c8bf4d373c0632a66
msgid "Visualising matched-filter SNR time series with gwexpy"
msgstr "gwexpy で SNR 時系列を可視化する"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:10020
#: e103e1e1a41b4820b7c2c05aa19366c5
msgid ""
"**Note**: This notebook works without a PyCBC installation. When PyCBC is "
"absent the matched-filter step uses a simplified analytic substitute so "
"every cell still executes. Install PyCBC with `pip install pycbc` for real "
"searches."
msgstr ""
"**注**：このノートブックは PyCBC のインストールがなくても動作します。PyCBC "
"が存在しない場合、マッチドフィルタのステップは簡略化された解析的代替を用いるため、すべてのセルが実行されます。実際の探索には `pip install "
"pycbc` で PyCBC をインストールしてください。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:20002
#: 984463f4c3d14a9e8d0186ceb790f14b
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "準備"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:40002
#: a73c6848c2d54b6186dc64f35e11ca0c
msgid "1. Synthetic DARM Data with an Injected CBC Signal"
msgstr "1\\. CBC 信号を注入した合成 DARM データ"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:40004
#: b862e0ddae514c6e84f36c0931f4152c
msgid ""
"We create a 64 s segment of coloured noise and inject a synthetic binary "
"neutron star (BNS) inspiral — a chirp signal that sweeps from ~30 Hz to "
"~1000 Hz in the last few seconds before merger."
msgstr ""
"64 s のカラードノイズに合成 BNS (連星中性子星) インスパイラルを注入します。 チャープ信号は合体直前の数秒で ~30 Hz から ~1000"
" Hz に掃引します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:60002
#: 9fae084dc4b84741a0a4433eaead70de
msgid "2. gwexpy → PyCBC Conversion"
msgstr "2\\. gwexpy → PyCBC 変換"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:60004
#: 564b290b27af4adf8140c8b81e14fc19
msgid ""
"`to_pycbc_timeseries()` maps a gwexpy `TimeSeries` to a "
"`pycbc.types.TimeSeries`.  Metadata (t0, dt, unit) is preserved."
msgstr ""
"`to_pycbc_timeseries()` は gwexpy の `TimeSeries` を `pycbc.types.TimeSeries` "
"に変換します。メタデータ（t0、dt、単位）は保持されます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:80002
#: deb382f326c04dfc9eb81bcde974299e
msgid "3. PSD / ASD Conversion"
msgstr "3\\. PSD / ASD 変換"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:80004
#: 8bf2eb227a0747b9bb271d24ea39d8f4
msgid ""
"A matched filter requires a **noise PSD** to whiten the data. We estimate "
"the ASD from the gwexpy `TimeSeries` and convert it to a PyCBC "
"`FrequencySeries` for use as the matched-filter PSD."
msgstr ""
"マッチドフィルタはデータをホワイトニングするために**ノイズ PSD** を必要とします。gwexpy の `TimeSeries` から ASD "
"を推定し、それを PyCBC の `FrequencySeries` に変換してマッチドフィルタの PSD として使用します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:100002
#: 0ee9cb8c374446c98bccbc3145bb1195
msgid "4. Matched-Filter Search (BNS Template)"
msgstr "4\\. マッチトフィルター探索（BNS テンプレート）"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:100004
#: 75b042b641d14fa1adf57bc8ba5423a0
msgid ""
"A matched filter computes the cross-correlation between the data and a "
"template waveform, normalised by the noise PSD.  The peak of the normalised "
"SNR time series $\\rho(t)$ indicates the merger time."
msgstr ""
"マッチトフィルターはデータとテンプレート波形の相互相関を ノイズ PSD で正規化して計算します。 正規化 SNR 時系列 $\\rho(t)$ "
"のピークが合体時刻を示します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:100008
#: a3d65f1b29aa49179f47202560c1fa87
msgid ""
"\\rho(t) = \\frac{4}{\\sigma} \\, \\text{Re} \\int_0^\\infty "
"\\frac{\\tilde{d}(f)\\,\\tilde{h}^*(f)}{S_n(f)} e^{2\\pi i f t} \\, df"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:120002
#: 586384346c434054b8c22878af1f95a9
msgid "5. Visualise the SNR Time Series"
msgstr "5\\. SNR 時系列の可視化"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_pycbc_search.ipynb:120004
#: 3abb308b4ee34cd2b23fcbc9d0f30934
msgid ""
"Plot the matched-filter SNR as a function of time, with the injected merger "
"time marked."
msgstr "注入された合体時刻を示した上で、マッチドフィルタ SNR を時間の関数としてプロットします。"

